api_contracts:
POST /v1/rollouts/leases -> {client_id, route, ttl_seconds} returns {lease_id, issued_at, expires_at, signature}
PUT /v1/rollouts/leases/{lease_id}/renew -> renews ttl
POST /v1/rollouts/exposures -> {lease_id, exposure_key, model_version, sample_seed} idempotent by (lease_id, exposure_key)
GET /v1/rollouts/leases/{lease_id}/signals -> long-poll or websocket upgrade returns events: {type: 'REVOKE'|'WARN', reason, issued_at}
Notes: All endpoints accept and return ISO8601 timestamps; auth via rollout tokens scoped to routes. Rate limits apply to lease issuance (per-client per-route).
